{"schema_version": 2, "unit_id": "tag:0071:prose-0001", "parent_tag": "0071", "chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "paragraph", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet us clarify the definition of sheaves of certain types of structures.\nFirst, let us reformulate the sheaf condition. Namely, suppose that\n<MATH_0001> is a presheaf of sets on the topological space <MATH_0002>.\nThe sheaf condition can be reformulated as follows. Let\n<MATH_0003> be an open covering. Consider the\ndiagram\n<MATH_0004>\nHere the left map is defined by the rule\n<MATH_0005>. The two maps\non the right are the maps\n<MATHSEG_0001> resp. <MATHSEG_0002>\nThe sheaf condition exactly says that the left arrow\nis the equalizer of the right two. This generalizes\nimmediately to the case of presheaves with values in a\ncategory as long as the category has products.\n\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$U = \\bigcup_{i\\in I} U_i$", "MATH_0004": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{F}(U) \\ar[r]\n&\n\\prod\\nolimits_{i\\in I}\n\\mathcal{F}(U_i)\n\\ar@<1ex>[r] \\ar@<-1ex>[r]\n&\n\\prod\\nolimits_{(i_0, i_1) \\in I \\times I}\n\\mathcal{F}(U_{i_0} \\cap U_{i_1})\n}\n$$", "MATH_0005": "$s \\mapsto \\prod_{i \\in I} s|_{U_i}$", "MATHSEG_0001": "$$\n\\prod\\nolimits_i s_i\n\\mapsto\n\\prod\\nolimits_{(i_0, i_1)} s_{i_0}|_{U_{i_0} \\cap U_{i_1}}\n\\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "}\n\\prod\\nolimits_i s_i\n\\mapsto\n\\prod\\nolimits_{(i_0, i_1)} s_{i_1}|_{U_{i_0} \\cap U_{i_1}}.\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "math_text_regions": [{"region_id": "math/0001", "delimiter_kind": "display-dollar", "source": "$$\n\\prod\\nolimits_i s_i\n\\mapsto\n\\prod\\nolimits_{(i_0, i_1)} s_{i_0}|_{U_{i_0} \\cap U_{i_1}}\n\\text{ resp. }\n\\prod\\nolimits_i s_i\n\\mapsto\n\\prod\\nolimits_{(i_0, i_1)} s_{i_1}|_{U_{i_0} \\cap U_{i_1}}.\n$$", "source_hash": "sha256:9aabe33f83038bc0e4807821678816366e7b7a1c5ae9575fbb54f16b27256004", "source_byte_span": {"start": 652, "end": 851}, "pieces": [{"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0001"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0002"}], "slots": [{"slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001", "source": " resp. ", "command": "text", "policy_entry": "p0-frame-sheaves-04", "slot_byte_span": {"start": 98, "end": 105}, "boundary_placeholders": ["MATHSEG_0001", "MATHSEG_0002"], "classification_witness": {"usage": "p0-locked-math-frame", "usage_source": {"before": "}\n", "after": "\n\\prod", "environments": []}, "source_label": "sheaves-section-sheaves-structures", "policy_hash": "sha256:71d3aca14a16ed05f2eb0827d4ff6e145236bad3cff1e9e685dc675c059dd357", "anchor": {"source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "file": "sheaves.tex", "owner_tag": "0071", "owner_label": "sheaves-section-sheaves-structures", "kind": "section", "ordinal": 1, "matches": [{"container_byte_span": {"start": 23378, "end": 24434}, "container_hash": "sha256:6e2bb4ca6a3bf09a496b539632be415c3fc524dc58ca1616d2ff91ed741745d0", "command_byte_span": {"start": 24120, "end": 24134}, "command_hash": "sha256:08081d2fa47145197ddd336eb938ecb68e1466f05df25e5baef1678ae4d46898"}]}}}]}], "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:29bebe0908d4baacd5dde0c8e398129496760472b8c3e57c4f3f1371af396f00", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c508794019104477a42d3090a541b1d14c9509d557ca442077c9fa3eb03b1551", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:704e274fb3257e3aa2e95e5874cfcb4ea5c1d13c49dd212741a9ebeca25aae5a", "source_math_hash": "sha256:edf7550f6f843a6cca212fcfc7b461b3a2c31f8cc3ed812bd9324be9cf42bee4"}
